# Angel of Vitality wears Loxodon Warhammer (+3/+0, trample, lifelink): a 5/2 flier. Bot2's Healer's Hawk blocks it, and
# it assigns 1 to the Hawk and tramples 4 over to Bot2. One source dealing combat damage to several recipients at once
# causes one life gain event (CR 120.3f; Angel of Vitality's 2024-11-08 ruling), so the Angel adds 1 once: Bot1 gains
# 5 + 1 = 6 (20 -> 26), not 7. Bot2 loses 4 and the Hawk's lifelink gains it 1 (20 -> 17). At 26 life the Angel is
# 7/4, and survives the Hawk's 1 damage.

